<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0355_R16R0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If you cruise down Cycling Road, you\nend up in Fuchsia City.\rOr in the hospital. 50/50.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0355_R16R0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I got cameras, homie. Smile.\nNow what you want?\rWassup, wassup. Wanna hear a TRENDY\nsayin’? I’m a influencer. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0355_R16R0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight...\rThe trendy thing for you to say would\nbe...\r{STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0}!\rThat’s mad trendy. Say it\neverywhere. To your mama. To the\fcops.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0355_R16R0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, c’MON! With a attitude like that,\nyou gon’ fall off! You already fallin’\foff!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0355_R16R0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I hope you use trendy sayin’s in\ntrendy ways. Don’t be cringe with it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0355_R16R0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, wassup. You usin’\ntrendy sayin’s?</language>
	</row>
</body>
